{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/42206fe9db71ff3f161a6a9c05b3f8cc.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BANDIT KNIGHT, strategy is key as you sneak, pickpocket, and swipe treasures from the greedy and corrupt. Move like a shadow, unlock secret pathways, and outsmart puzzles. But remember\u2014staying hidden isn\u2019t just an option, it\u2019s your lifeline! One wrong move, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/2508f554b3fcd2080bfc2ed2020bbd48.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/2508f554b3fcd2080bfc2ed2020bbd48.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/b35cfa38e85320c9cf50ecea3b42cb4d.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission throws new challenges your way: tricky guards, clever puzzles, and fresh opportunities to grab valuable loot. Use the environment to your advantage, and hone your craft by spending gold coins. Outwit your foes and build your legacy as the greatest thief in history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/4913de0fa0afc720750a5bc480a14350.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/4913de0fa0afc720750a5bc480a14350.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/a43683c0d21720b124f6a95e1dbd31e6.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each heist, send out a Warning Letter to raise the stakes. Choose one of three letters to twist the rules \u2014 tougher guards, shorter timers, and unpredictable effects. But with higher risks come greater rewards: rarer loot, bigger hauls, and the thrill of pulling off the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/e05b295d9350f5005b31765e04aa05ed.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/e05b295d9350f5005b31765e04aa05ed.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/b51dd3cf8729e6e41709f3b9bf38ab52.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vast deserts to endless seas, bustling towns to mysterious vaults\u2014each map in BANDIT KNIGHT presents unique challenges and treasures to uncover. Travel through stunning environments and claim your place as a master thief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/60f9046e7b2c5ba1fa82d3e320547820.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/60f9046e7b2c5ba1fa82d3e320547820.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/05fb64332d2a92dd4575ae61200c740b.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The treasures you steal are more than just trophies\u2014they\u2019re the key to unlocking powerful upgrades! Use your loot to boost your stealth, unlock new abilities, and prepare for your next daring mission. Forge legendary equipment to grow stronger, and carve your own legend in the world of thieves. The bigger the risk, the greater the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/bb87aa651eace8fdef9602e979d9b348.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/bb87aa651eace8fdef9602e979d9b348.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0fDepending on your language settings, the title may show up as BANDIT KNIGHT, \u5077\u5929\u9a91\u58eb, or \u5077\u5929\u9a0e\u58eb \u2014 but it\u2019s the same thieving knight! \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2421000?t=1763634497","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763634497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/4087d6d8aa45612c221dfec0f94c926b77f7ac23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763634497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/4087d6d8aa45612c221dfec0f94c926b77f7ac23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763634497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>IMAGE AND VIDEO SHARING GUIDELINE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure that as many players as possible can enjoy the free demo of <i>BANDIT KNIGHT</i>, we\u2019ve set up the following guidelines for posting videos and images.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please follow these guidelines when sharing content on video platforms and social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is &quot;Video Posting&quot;\uff1f</strong>In these guidelines, &quot;video posting&quot; refers to uploading videos that players have pre-recorded and edited, as well as live streams, including gameplay commentary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allowed Content</strong>You are free to post videos and images from any section of the <i>BANDIT KNIGHT</i>, free demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t need to apply or go through any procedures to post videos or images of the game. Please note that we do not provide individual responses to inquiries about this.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from engaging in behavior that may lead to defamation or personal attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not post illegal or inappropriate content, or anything that goes against public decency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not provide any guarantees regarding the posting of gameplay videos, including whether or not third-party rights are being infringed. We are not responsible for any damages that may occur to the uploader or third parties as a result of the content being shared. Thank you for your understanding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not post content that focuses solely on in-game audio, such as voice, BGM, or sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Monetization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is completely acceptable to earn revenue through YouTube, Twitch's partner program, or advertisements on other video-sharing platforms. No permission from the developer or publisher is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that these guidelines may be updated after the official release of the game. Make sure to check for the latest version before posting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/42206fe9db71ff3f161a6a9c05b3f8cc.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BANDIT KNIGHT, strategy is key as you sneak, pickpocket, and swipe treasures from the greedy and corrupt. Move like a shadow, unlock secret pathways, and outsmart puzzles. But remember\u2014staying hidden isn\u2019t just an option, it\u2019s your lifeline! One wrong move, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/2508f554b3fcd2080bfc2ed2020bbd48.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/2508f554b3fcd2080bfc2ed2020bbd48.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/b35cfa38e85320c9cf50ecea3b42cb4d.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission throws new challenges your way: tricky guards, clever puzzles, and fresh opportunities to grab valuable loot. Use the environment to your advantage, and hone your craft by spending gold coins. Outwit your foes and build your legacy as the greatest thief in history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/4913de0fa0afc720750a5bc480a14350.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/4913de0fa0afc720750a5bc480a14350.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/a43683c0d21720b124f6a95e1dbd31e6.avif?t=1763634497\" width=591 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each heist, send out a Warning Letter to raise the stakes. Choose one of three letters to twist the rules \u2014 tougher guards, shorter timers, and unpredictable effects. But with higher risks come greater rewards: rarer loot, bigger hauls, and the thrill of pulling off the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas