s, and prepare for your next daring mission. Forge legendary equipment to grow stronger, and carve your own legend in the world of thieves. The bigger the risk, the greater the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/bb87aa651eace8fdef9602e979d9b348.poster.avif?t=1763634497\" width=650 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/extras/bb87aa651eace8fdef9602e979d9b348.webm?t=1763634497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0fDepending on your language settings, the title may show up as BANDIT KNIGHT, \u5077\u5929\u9a91\u58eb, or \u5077\u5929\u9a0e\u58eb \u2014 but it\u2019s the same thieving knight! \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f</p>","developers":["Game Float"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421000/header.jpg?t=1763634497","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421000/1762099908/04fe4431c3c4792e37544e9c363de765310fe37f/1763095498/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763605831","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421000/1762099908/04fe4431c3c4792e37544e9c363de765310fe37f/1763095498/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763605831","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2421000/1762099908/04fe4431c3c4792e37544e9c363de765310fe37f/1763095498/